## The Problem with Doomsayers

Philosophers have been predicting the end of humanity for centuries.

They said the automobile would destroy horse-breeding culture.
They said the printing press would destroy memory.
They said the radio would destroy language.

They were right about one thing: **tools change us**.

They were wrong about the rest: **we don't go extinct. We evolve.**

---

## Marshall McLuhan Was Right

Marshall McLuhan understood this better than anyone.

He proved that every tool is an **extension of human capability**:

- **Wheel** extends the leg
- **Book** extends the eye
- **Radio** extends the ear
- **Internet** extends the nervous system
- **AI** extends the mind

This isn't dystopia. **This is evolution.**

